            {
              "id": "AP10",
              "name": "AgentImageNotPinnedToADigest",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Agent image not pinned to a digest"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A mutable tag such as :latest can change under you, so what you tested is not what runs."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Pin the base image by digest (image@sha256:...) and update it on purpose. BRACE checklist: B10, C01.",
                "markdown": "A mutable tag such as :latest can change under you, so what you tested is not what runs.\n\n**Fix:** Pin the base image by digest (image@sha256:...) and update it on purpose.\n\nBRACE checklist: B10, C01. [Details](https://braceframework.org/anti-patterns/#ap10-agent-image-not-pinned-to-a-digest)"
              },
